Description: AI-powered man page viewer for deepin
  deepin-iman is a man page browser that deeply integrates AI capabilities
  with traditional man page experience. It allows users to browse, search,
  and navigate all man pages, and leverages AI to provide multi-language
  translation, usage examples, command Q&A, and command parsing.
  .
  Key features:
   * Full-text search with case-sensitivity and whole-word match toggles
   * Cross-reference navigation (SEE ALSO links)
   * AI-powered translation (user-configurable OpenAI-compatible providers)
   * Inline split view for translation and examples
   * AI-generated usage examples
   * AI Q&A and command parsing
   * Favorites and browse history (auto-trimmed to 100 entries)
   * Auto index update on startup plus manual refresh
